	(text "BUCK A — +12V_SERVO, 10–20 A, LM5145 controller + external FETs\nGolden reference: datasheets/reference/ti-snvu545-lm5145evm-hd-20a.pdf (copy the EVM layout), datasheets/lm5145.pdf\nWEBENCH design still to collect (datasheets/README.md) — currents follow decision D1.\nParts (LCSC): LM5145RGYR C485912; FETs, inductor, caps from the WEBENCH BOM\nConsumes: +19V_IN, GND.  Produces: +12V_SERVO (shared bulk bank lives here; per-port caps live on servo-port)\nName the switch node SW and the bootstrap node BOOT — the SW_NODE net class is assigned by project pattern /buck-*/SW and /buck-*/BOOT.\nOpen items: D1 (fleet → current), V3 (behaviour on regen overvoltage)\nBring-up: test point + power-good LED on +12V_SERVO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
